<!-- IMPORTANT: keep every COMMENT ASCII-only, never Chinese.
     AutoUpdater.NET downloads with the system ANSI codepage instead of UTF-8, so Chinese text inside
     comments becomes mojibake and can destroy the comment terminator, swallowing the elements that
     follow it -> "XML document has an error" and the whole update check fails (hit on 2026-09-10).
     The changelog TEXT node is safe: garbled text does not break the element structure. -->
